WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.710
Our line names are ALL CAPS. They never go to the customer.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:08.820
Open the line item. The Customer tab holds the Description.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.620
Write the Description for the customer.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.130
On their estimate, the Description is what prints.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:19.460
Say our location. Never the shop. Never the factory.
